  "concept": { "zh": "钥匙会放出光束 · 三种仓图", "en": "A key releases a beam · Three vault layouts" },
  "brief": { "zh": "在三班仓图里都取出两箱印章，再回西端出口。钥匙会同时解开宝箱、继电室门和挡光闸，光束随即穿过中央过道。继电室的踏板能断电。工单用 key_side 和 relay_side 标出两个房间的方向，用 key_depth 和 relay_depth 标出从主廊到房间尽头的格数。同一程序需完成三班。", "en": "Recover both seals and return to the west exit on all three shifts. The key unlocks both chests, the relay room and the shutter that keeps the laser out of the hall. The relay pedal cuts power. On the work order, key_side and relay_side give the directions of the rooms. The distances from the hall to the back of each room are key_depth and relay_depth. Use one program for all three shifts." },
